/E ( directly into civilian R&D funding criteria, requiring private firms to make intellectual property and data available to the People's Liberation Army on demand, and using state-owned enterprises as conduits to pull commercial technology into defense programs. Beijing has committed over $68 billion in dedicated MCF investment funds since 2015.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0 165 0 R 2]
